# Implementation Plan - Project AegisCore

Architect and implement "Project AegisCore," an enterprise-grade multi-agent orchestrator using the AWS Fullstack AgentCore Solution Template (FAST).

## Proposed Changes

### Foundation and Infrastructure (FAST)
- Initialize project with FAST structure.
- Define CDK stacks for Cognito, Bedrock AgentCore Runtime/Gateway/Memory.
- Setup React frontend with AWS Cloudscape Design System.

#### [NEW] [cdk-stack.ts](file:///d:/PROJECTS/Development/NOVA%20Amazon%20Hackathon/infra/cdk-stack.ts)
- Base infrastructure definition.

### Multi-Agent Orchestration Engine
- Create Supervisor Agent using Nova 2 Pro.
- Implement breakdown and routing logic.

#### [NEW] [supervisor.py](file:///d:/PROJECTS/Development/NOVA%20Amazon%20Hackathon/backend/agents/supervisor.py)
- Supervisor agent implementation.

### UI Automation (Nova Act)
- Implement Nova Act sub-agent for browser automation.
- Setup `human_input_callbacks` for approvals and CAPTCHAs.

#### [NEW] [web_automation_agent.py](file:///d:/PROJECTS/Development/NOVA%20Amazon%20Hackathon/backend/agents/web_automation_agent.py)
- Nova Act integration.

### Data Grounding (MCP)
- Implement MCP server for browser data and SQL cross-referencing.

#### [NEW] [nova_act_mcp_server.py](file:///d:/PROJECTS/Development/NOVA%20Amazon%20Hackathon/mcp_servers/nova_act_mcp_server.py)
