### Voice Integration (Nova Sonic)
- Integrate Nova Sonic for speech-to-speech interaction.
- Bidirectional WebSocket setup.

#### [NEW] [VoiceInterface.tsx](file:///d:/PROJECTS/Development/NOVA%20Amazon%20Hackathon/frontend/src/components/VoiceInterface.tsx)
